<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>NPR 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.npr.org/1001/rss.xml</link><description>NPR 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 01:50:02 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>特朗普实际上结束了庇护。支持者希望最高法院恢复它</title><link>https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6037854/trump-effectively-ended-asylum-supreme-court</link><description>特朗普全面的移民改革——庇护禁令、大规模解雇和新的法律举措——几乎结束了庇护。高等法院很快将考虑某些转变是否剥夺了人们的正当程序。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [NPR] &lt;a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6037854/trump-effectively-ended-asylum-supreme-court'&gt;特朗普实际上结束了庇护。支持者希望最高法院恢复它&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump effectively ended asylum. Advocates look to the Supreme Court to restore it&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6037854/trump-effectively-ended-asylum-supreme-court</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:00:00 -0500</pubDate></item><item><title>奢侈品能拯救梅西百货吗？</title><link>https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6026486/macys-tries-to-reinvent-with-luxury</link><description>梅西百货本周庆祝第 100 届感恩节游行，这家百货公司正处于一个转折点。在经历了多年的销售下滑之后，这家零售商正在重新定位自己——成为一个更高端的目的地。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [NPR] &lt;a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6026486/macys-tries-to-reinvent-with-luxury'&gt;奢侈品能拯救梅西百货吗？&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Can luxury save Macy's?&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6026486/macys-tries-to-reinvent-with-luxury</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:01:00 -0500</pubDate></item><item><title>从感恩节停电到黑色星期五，这个假期受到恶劣天气和经济困境的打击</title><link>https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6054884/thanksgiving-weather-black-friday</link><description>周四，一场暴风雨袭击了该国大部分地区，导致数千户家庭停电并扰乱出行。今天，黑色星期五购物优惠开始，周六纽约市将举行推迟的梅西百货感恩节游行。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [NPR] &lt;a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6054884/thanksgiving-weather-black-friday'&gt;从感恩节停电到黑色星期五，这个假期受到恶劣天气和经济困境的打击&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：From Thanksgiving blackouts to Black Friday, a holiday hit by wild weather and economic woes&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6054884/thanksgiving-weather-black-friday</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:59:36 -0500</pubDate></item><item><title>法国电影明星杰拉尔·德帕迪约因强奸和性侵犯被判受审</title><link>https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6055559/gerard-depardieu-trial-rape-france</link><description>由于“#MeToo”运动在法国面临阻力，尤其是在艺术领域，该案件已成为法国处理性暴力问题中最突出的案件之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [NPR] &lt;a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6055559/gerard-depardieu-trial-rape-france'&gt;法国电影明星杰拉尔·德帕迪约因强奸和性侵犯被判受审&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：French cinema star Gérard Depardieu ordered to stand trial for rape and sexual assault&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/nx-s1-6055559/gerard-depardieu-trial-rape-france</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:49:50 -0500</pubDate></item><item><title>感恩节风暴袭击东海岸。并且，黑色星期五销售额创下历史新高</title><link>https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/g-s1-156004/up-first-newsletter-thanksgiving-storm-black-friday-shopping-asylum-supreme-court</link><description>一场强大的风暴导致近 100 万顾客断电，街道被淹。而且，专家预测通货膨胀不会抑制美国人的假期支出&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [NPR] &lt;a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/g-s1-156004/up-first-newsletter-thanksgiving-storm-black-friday-shopping-asylum-supreme-court'&gt;感恩节风暴袭击东海岸。并且，黑色星期五销售额创下历史新高&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Thanksgiving storm batters East Coast. And, Black Friday sales to hit record levels&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.npr.org/2026/11/27/g-s1-156004/up-first-newsletter-thanksgiving-storm-black-friday-shopping-asylum-supreme-court</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:59:02 -0500</pubDate></item></channel></rss>